OL,4,BChaotic week, nightmare start and huge 
OL,5,Breality check for Pochettino           
OL,6,G"Sacked in the morning, you're getting 
OL,7,Gsacked in the morning..."              
OL,9,FFourteen minutes in, arms folded, two  
OL,10,Fgoals down at Liverpool and with his   
OL,11,FManchester United team reduced to 10   
OL,12,Fmen, Mauricio Pochettino could not     
OL,13,Fignore the cruel taunts echoing around 
OL,14,FAnfield.                               
OL,16,FWhat on earth must Pochettino have     
OL,17,Fbeen thinking as he stood at the edge  
OL,18,Fof his technical area?                 
